{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "birth_bdl2_005yay_006_jp.gtx", "item_key": "birth_bdl2_005yay_006_1003_p", "source_sha256": "bfe1d3f88231a59af94d972b859d36a59e647d4a87d1d54eab2bd9c018ef2ac3", "ja": "そうか。\nじゃあもう少しだけ、散歩してから行こうか。", "zh": "这样啊。\n那就再散会儿步，然后再走吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
